# GESIS-licensed microdata, and any person-level file derived from it, must
# never enter this repository: the usage regulations carry a breach clause and
# a push cannot be taken back. These patterns are a mechanical backstop, not a
# substitute for keeping the licensed file outside the working tree. Nothing
# matching them has ever been committed; if you need to commit one, force it
# deliberately and say why.
*.dta
*.sav
*.por
*.rds
*.RData
.Rhistory
.Rdata
# Note: /_freeze/ is intentionally NOT ignored – it must be committed so CI can deploy without running R

**/*.quarto_ipynb
/*.md
!/README.md
/.luarc.json
